---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="About" description="The person behind word and mouth — superpowers, story, and why playfulness is the point">
  <section class="hero-small">
    <h1>I'm Dave.<span class="highlight">*</span></h1>
    <p class="hero-asterisk-note">* The one who believes your best work happens when you're having fun.</p>
  </section>
  
  <section class="section">
    <h2 class="section-label">What I Actually Do</h2>
    <div class="what-i-do">
      <p class="lead">
        I help organisations find the <strong>big problem</strong> they actually solve — then turn it into a story that 
        colleagues and clients <em>want</em> to tell.<span class="vv">*</span>
      </p>
      <p class="asterisk-note"><span class="vv">*</span> Not a tagline. A shared understanding that changes how everyone shows up.</p>
      
      <p>
        Along the way, I build things. AI-powered tools. Prototypes. Systems that make insight accessible.
        In the last 4 months: 12 products shipped, from investigative journalism platforms to pizza truck operating systems.
      </p>
      <p>
        I work with AI agents as my construction crew — which means I can explore ideas at speed, 
        test hunches fast, and give you working proof instead of slide decks.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
  
  <section class="section">
    <h2 class="section-label">The Superpowers</h2>
    
    <div class="superpowers">
      <div class="superpower">
        <h3>🔗 Triangulation<span class="vv">*</span></h3>
        <p>I research from angles you'd never consider. Multiple sources, competing perspectives, hidden patterns — synthesised into clarity.</p>
        <p class="asterisk-note"><span class="vv">*</span> This is how you find what everyone else missed.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="superpower">
        <h3>✂️ Simplification</h3>
        <p>Complex doesn't mean complicated. I find the essence and make it accessible — without dumbing it down.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="superpower">
        <h3>🛠️ Building</h3>
        <p>I don't just advise. I ship. Working prototypes in weeks, not months.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="superpower">
        <h3>🎭 Purposeful Play<span class="vv">*</span></h3>
        <p>Serious results don't require a sombre attitude. Joy is a multiplier. Curiosity is a strategy.</p>
        <p class="asterisk-note"><span class="vv">*</span> This is the whole point. If it's not fun, we're doing it wrong.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  
  <section class="section">
    <h2 class="section-label">The Short Version</h2>
    <div class="bio">
      <p>
        30 years in content, communications, and making sense of chaos. 
        Started as a <strong>journalist</strong>. Became a <strong>content strategist</strong>. Now I <strong>build things</strong>.
      </p>
      <p>
        I've worked with BT, the UK Home Office, RCI, and helped 680+ people 
        find clarity through ADPList mentoring.
      </p>
      <p>
        Currently based in <strong>Berlin</strong>. Previously: Tenerife, Manchester, 
        Nottingham, and wherever there's good coffee and interesting problems.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
  
  <section class="section">
    <h2 class="section-label">The Revelation</h2>
    <div class="revelation-box">
      <p>
        I recently realised something. The storytelling framework I've been developing for years — 
        the one that helps clients find their voice — it came from somewhere specific.
      </p>
      <p>
        <strong>Carl Sagan's Cosmos.</strong><span class="vv">*</span>
      </p>
      <p class="asterisk-note">
        <span class="vv">*</span> The series that taught me: awe opens minds that logic cannot. 
        Going "out of this world" is how you see what's right in front of you.
      </p>
      <p>
        That's why the asterisk matters. It means <em>there's more here</em> — 
        the deeper story beneath the surface. That's what I help you find.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
  
  <section class="section cta-section">
    <h2>Want to work together?<span class="vv">*</span></h2>
    <p class="asterisk-note"><span class="vv">*</span> I take on 2 new clients per quarter. Let's see if we're a fit.</p>
    <a href="mailto:dave@wordandmouth.com" class="cta-button">Start a Conversation</a>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .hero-small {
    padding: 10rem 2rem 4rem;
    max-width: 900px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }
  
  .hero-small h1 {
    font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 4rem);
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }
  
  .hero-asterisk-note {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    font-style: italic;
    max-width: 600px;
  }
  
  .what-i-do .lead {
    font-size: 1.4rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }
  
  .what-i-do p {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    max-width: 700px;
  }
  
  .asterisk-note {
    font-size: 0.95rem !important;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-style: italic;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    padding-left: 0.5rem;
    border-left: 2px solid var(--accent);
  }
  
  .superpowers {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
    gap: 2rem;
  }
  
  .superpower {
    background: #111;
    padding: 1.5rem;
    border-left: 3px solid transparent;
    transition: border-color 0.2s;
  }
  
  .superpower:hover {
    border-left-color: var(--accent);
  }
  
  .superpower h3 {
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }
  
  .superpower p {
    color: var(--muted);
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }
  
  .superpower .asterisk-note {
    margin-top: 1rem;
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }
  
  .bio p {
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    max-width: 700px;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
  
  .bio strong {
    color: var(--accent);
  }
  
  .revelation-box {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255, 107, 53, 0.08) 0%, rgba(255, 107, 53, 0.02) 100%);
    padding: 2rem;
    border-left: 3px solid var(--accent);
  }
  
  .revelation-box p {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  
  .revelation-box p:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }
  
  .revelation-box .asterisk-note {
    background: rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
    padding: 1rem;
    border-left: none;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  
  .cta-section {
    text-align: center;
  }
  
  .cta-section h2 {
    font-size: 2rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }
  
  .cta-section .asterisk-note {
    border-left: none;
    padding-left: 0;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }
</style>
